        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "Presbyopia does not occur in the pediatric population.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-pilocarpine-125",
          "section": "8.4"
        }
      ]
